    "title" : "14 Bounty, Long Bay, Auckland - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730884145901\" id=\"item-672b1afca723ff47aa2d55a5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-1db228b7e5e31cca03f2\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Six generously sized bedrooms, each thoughtfully designed with natural light and ample wardrobe space.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> Two sleek, modern bathrooms featuring high-quality fixtures and finishes, adding a touch of luxury to everyday routines.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Areas:</strong> Three separate living spaces, each offering versatility to suit any lifestyle need\u2014from formal gatherings to cozy family time.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong> A contemporary chef\u2019s kitchen with premium appliances, ample cabinetry, and a spacious layout that makes cooking and entertaining effortless.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> A secure, single-car garage provides convenient parking and additional storage.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living:</strong> Set on a landscaped property, the outdoor area is ideal for dining alfresco or unwinding in a peaceful setting, with plenty of room for children to play.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Combining elegance with a practical floor plan, 14 Bounty in Long Bay is a rare find for those looking to experience the best of Auckland living. With its prime location, spacious interiors, and quality finishes, this home is perfect for growing families or anyone looking for a harmonious blend of comfort and style.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672b2e57517053310148fa2d&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672b2e57517053310148fa2d&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_295636\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672b2e85aeae906c4932d9e5\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730883210896-X80ZB5M4JYZAUPYX4EHB/14+Bounty++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Pho